description:
We're looking for motivated people who treat every project as their own and are always open to new ideas and approaches.
Join the CodeLions team as a Full Stack Engineer and become part of the rapidly developing company! 💙
Requirements:
- 3+ years of experience in React and Python;
- Strong knowledge of MySQL, Postgres
- Able to propose creative solutions to complex problems;
- Good communication and self-learning skills;
- Level of English: Upper-Intermediate, both writing and speaking;
70% - React / 30% - Python
Responsibilities:
- Responsible for implementing quality code that satisfies code quality best practices;
- Support the estimation of the user stories and associated tasks;
- Responsible for the quality of the project;
- Propose refactoring, modifications, and improvements;
- Propose technologies or architectures;
- Participate in code review;
- Follow agreed workflows and standards, and propose process improvement when necessary.
Interview stages:
- HR interview (20 minutes)
- Tech interview (1 hour)
